  {
   "_id": 31973,
   "ANSWER": "<p>8086 has a <strong data-end=\"489\" data-start=\"467\">20-bit address bus</strong>, allowing it to address up to <strong data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"520\">1 MB (2&sup2;\u2070 bytes)</strong> of memory.</p>\n",
